  "merger_description": "TDR Capital LLP, through entities it controls, specifically Nova Bidco Limited, proposes to acquire Oat Topco Limited (**OCU Group**)\n\nTDR Capital LLP is a global private equity firm that invests in a variety of sectors including motor fuels, retail, gyms and health clubs, pubs and restaurants, and debt purchasing. Aggreko, one of TDR\u2019s portfolio companies,\u00a0supplies temporary and longer-term power and energy solutions.\n\nOCU Group is a UK-based infrastructure services and engineering group operating principally across power transmission and distribution, energy transformation, digital infrastructure and water and environmental solutions. In Australia, OCU Group provides integrated energy transition and power infrastructure solutions, combining advisory, engineering, construction and maintenance capabilities across electrical, mechanical and civil works.",
